  USING ( SELECT 'GET_ADMIN_GROUP_MEASURE' AS LOOKUP_TYPE, 'SCP Planner' AS SEGMENT1, 'DMF0082' AS SEGMENT2, '40' AS SEGMENT3, 'SCM_FCST' AS SEGMENT4, '-' AS SEGMENT5, 5 AS DISPLAY_SEQ, 'Y' AS VALID_YN, '한정된 시간에 입력하는 메져에 대해서만 해당 메져와 같이 입력하며, limit measure에는 해당 메져가 edit y가 되는경우 edit n으로 변경되여야 하는 메져명을 작성한다.' AS DESCRIPTION, 'WED' AS ATTRIBUTE1, '0000' AS ATTRIBUTE2, '1700' AS ATTRIBUTE3, 'MKT_FCST' AS ATTRIBUTE4, NULL AS ATTRIBUTE5, 'dsiol' AS CREATED_BY, TO_DATE('2025-05-19 10:38:37','YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS') AS CREATION_DATE, 'admin' AS LAST_UPDATED_BY, TO_DATE('2026-08-14 08:54:49','YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS') AS LAST_UPDATE_DATE FROM DUAL ) S
